{"ref":"BDB, רִישׁ","hw":"רִישׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רִישׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵישׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵאשׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.m. poverty</strong>, only Pr;—<span dir=\"rtl\">רִישׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.19\">28:19</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִישׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.7\">31:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵישׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.18\">13:18</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵישֶׁ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.34\">24:34</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֹרֶיךָ</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵישָׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.15\">10:15</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשִׁיר</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵאשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.8\">30:8</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹשֶׁר</span>), sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵאשֶׁ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.11\">6:11</a> (= <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.34\">24:34</a>, ‖ <em>id.</em>).","next":"BDB, רוּת","prev":"BDB, רוּשׁ"}